WeatherTech — System Architecture

Overview

WeatherTech is a concept prototype demonstrating Panchayat-level weather downscaling through an interactive web interface.

Current Architecture
User Interface: HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
Map Visualization: SVG-based interactive district, block, and panchayat views.
Data Processing: JavaScript generates illustrative subdivisions and synthetic weather values.
Weather Display: Temperature, rainfall probability, uncertainty range, terrain information, confidence, and agricultural advisories.

Workflow

1. Load the prototype in a web browser.
2. Display the illustrative Panchayat map.
3. Select Coarse Forecast or Downscaled View.
4. Select a Panchayat to view its displayed weather values and advisory.

Proposed Future Architecture

1. Obtain verified weather forecast data.
2. Integrate authentic Panchayat boundaries and elevation/slope data.
3. Develop and validate an AI/ML downscaling model.
4. Generate Panchayat-level rainfall and temperature estimates.
5. Display predictions, uncertainty ranges, and agricultural advisories.

